# TDD Mandatory

Mandatory:
- failing test before behavior change
- regression test for bug fixes
- deterministic and meaningful assertions
- integration/E2E tests MUST boot full application context (`@SpringBootTest` without `classes=`) with Testcontainers
- `@Import` and `@ContextConfiguration(classes=...)` are ONLY for slice tests (`@WebMvcTest`, `@DataJpaTest`) — NEVER for integration/E2E
- if application context fails to start, fix the application — never fix the test to skip context loading

No merge-ready status for behavior changes without test evidence.
